{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 23, :comments ["And the reason for <b>and all they that despise Me shall not see it</b> — for all they that despise Me shall not see it. And Ibn Ezra said: 'all they that despise Me' — of their children, and there is no reason in this. And perhaps this alludes to the generations that are exiled from it, according to the words of our Sages (Ta'anit 29a), and here He fixed for them weeping for generations on this night, that He may remind them of their first punishment."], :book :numbers, :voice :ramban, :lang :en, :chapter 14, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T04:05:33.040426062Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}